/li> </ul></div>   </figure></div></section> </div> <div id="revenue-impact-amenities"> <section class="my-12 space-y-6"><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">Airbnb Amenities Linked to Higher Revenue in Surfside Beach</h3><p>Listings in Surfside Beach with a game console earned <strong>about 2.5 times as much</strong> a year, on average, as those without: $102,000 against $41,400. The gap is smaller for a hammock (about 2.2 times as much) and beach access (about 2.2 times as much). Bigger, professionally run homes tend to carry more amenities, so these gaps reflect the kind of listing as much as the feature itself.</p><div class="not-prose"><figure class="pseo-figure font-lato rounded-[4px] bg-white shadow-[0_1px_2px_rgba(15,23,42,0.06),0_3px_14px_rgba(15,23,42,0.07)] p-5 sm:p-6 [&#38;_.pseo-table]:shadow-none"> <figcaption> <p class="text-[16px] font-bold leading-snug text-[#1e293b]">Revenue gap for Surfside Beach listings with each amenity</p> <p class="mt-1 text-[14px] leading-snug text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.6)]">How much more listings with the amenity earned in a year than those without, and the share of listings that have it</p>  </figcaption> <div class="mt-5"><ul class="pseo-bars grid grid-cols-[1fr_auto] gap-x-4 font-lato sm:grid-cols-[var(--label)_1fr_auto]" style="--label:220px"> <li class="col-span-full grid grid-cols-subgrid items-center gap-y-1.5 py-[7px]"> <span class="min-w-0 text-[14.5px] leading-tight text-[#1e293b]"> <span class="block truncate"> Game console </span>  </span> <span class="relative col-span-2 row-start-2 block h-2 rounded-[4px] sm:col-span-1 sm:row-start-1 sm:col-start-2" style="background:#e3e8ee"> <span class="block h-full rounded-[4px]" style="width:100%;background:#1976d2"></span>  </span> <span class="whitespace-nowrap text-right text-[14.5px] font-bold tabular-nums leading-tight text-[#1e293b]"> +148% <span class="ml-1.5 font-normal text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.6)]">on 3% of listings</span> </span> </li><li class="col-span-full grid grid-cols-subg